[SPEAKER_01]: Is it rooted in you want this and saying no to it?

402
00:29:20,517 --> 00:29:27,421
[SPEAKER_01]: Or is it rooted in you want this, saying no to this, that's experienced disagreeably, that you don't want?

403
00:29:30,723 --> 00:29:37,307
[SPEAKER_01]: So, circumstances arising, say, like a prospect of ill-will, but you restrain yourself.

404
00:29:37,588 --> 00:29:41,230
