[SPEAKER_01]: It became a problem when circumstances, they were unpleasant, you wanted to get rid of the displeasure through affecting the circumstances.

409
00:30:05,718 --> 00:30:12,720
[SPEAKER_01]: That's why you go and shout, beat people up, threaten them, so they never ever say that to you again.

410
00:30:14,485 --> 00:30:21,187
